# Raw ARM binaries: never line-ending-convert them
*.img binary

# git apply is byte-exact about line endings; a Windows checkout with
# core.autocrlf=true silently rewrites these to CRLF otherwise, which
# breaks `git apply` on Linux (confirmed: exactly this corrupted
# 0006-bcm2711-uart-baud.patch before this rule existed).
*.patch text eol=lf
